		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_OPTION_NEGATIVE_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Conquest: Negative Effects</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_OPTION_NEGATIVE_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Some abilities come with drawbacks (such as Vietnam's districts only on Woods, Rainforest or Marsh). Activation cannot be undone, so choose how drawbacks are handled.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_OPTION_NEGATIVE_SKIP_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Do Not Activate Drawbacks</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_OPTION_NEGATIVE_SKIP_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Activating an ability gives only its benefits; its drawbacks never apply to the conqueror. The original civilization keeps them.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_OPTION_NEGATIVE_CONFIRM_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Confirm Before Activating</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_OPTION_NEGATIVE_CONFIRM_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>Abilities are activated as they are, drawbacks included. Before activating one with drawbacks, a dialog lists them and asks you to confirm.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NOTE_NEGATIVE_SKIPPED" Language="en_US"><Text>Drawbacks of this ability (will NOT apply to you when activated):</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NOTE_NEGATIVE_KEPT" Language="en_US"><Text>Drawbacks of this ability (will apply to you when activated, and cannot be undone):</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NOTE_NOT_INHERITED" Language="en_US"><Text>These original effects are tied to the original civilization and are NOT inherited when activated:</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NI_ADJACENCY" Language="en_US"><Text>Its removed district adjacency rules (your districts keep the usual adjacency bonuses).</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NI_DISTRICT" Language="en_US"><Text>Cannot build the {1_District}.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NI_GREAT_PERSON" Language="en_US"><Text>Cannot earn {1_Class}.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NI_GOVERNOR" Language="en_US"><Text>The unique governor {1_Governor}.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NI_VISIBILITY" Language="en_US"><Text>Extra diplomatic visibility.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_CONFIRM_TITLE" Language="en_US"><Text>Activate abilities with drawbacks?</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_CONFIRM_TEXT" Language="en_US"><Text>These abilities also bring the drawbacks below. Activation cannot be undone; the drawbacks stay for the rest of the game.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_CONFIRM_ACTIVATE" Language="en_US"><Text>Activate</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_CONFIRM_ACTIVATE_ALL" Language="en_US"><Text>Activate All</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_CONFIRM_ACTIVATE_SAFE" Language="en_US"><Text>Only Those Without Drawbacks</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NEG_BABYLON_SCIENCE" Language="en_US"><Text>-50% [ICON_Science] Science in all cities.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NEG_NO_SURPRISE_WAR" Language="en_US"><Text>You cannot declare Surprise Wars.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NEG_GAUL_NO_ADJACENT" Language="en_US"><Text>Specialty districts cannot be built next to the City Center.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NEG_MALI_BUILDING_PRODUCTION" Language="en_US"><Text>-30% [ICON_Production] Production toward buildings (not wonders).</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NEG_MALI_UNIT_PRODUCTION" Language="en_US"><Text>-30% [ICON_Production] Production toward units.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NEG_MALI_MINES" Language="en_US"><Text>Mines give -1 [ICON_Production] Production.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NEG_MAORI_HARVEST" Language="en_US"><Text>Resources cannot be harvested.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NEG_MAYA_FRESH_WATER" Language="en_US"><Text>Cities get no [ICON_Housing] Housing from fresh water or coast.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NEG_VIETNAM_FEATURES" Language="en_US"><Text>Newly placed specialty districts can only go on Woods, Rainforest or Marsh (districts already built are kept).</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NEG_MUTAL_FAR_CITIES" Language="en_US"><Text>Cities 7 or more tiles from the [ICON_Capital] Capital get -15% to all yields.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NEG_FOREIGN_CONTINENT" Language="en_US"><Text>Cities on a continent other than your [ICON_Capital] Capital's get -15% to all yields.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NEG_TOKUGAWA_YIELDS" Language="en_US"><Text>International [ICON_TradeRoute] Trade Routes give -25% yields.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NEG_TOKUGAWA_TOURISM" Language="en_US"><Text>International [ICON_TradeRoute] Trade Routes give -25% [ICON_Tourism] Tourism.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NEG_JANISSARY_POPULATION" Language="en_US"><Text>Training a Janissary in a city you founded costs 1 [ICON_Citizen] Population.</Text></Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_UNIT_UNTRAINABLE_NOTE" Language="en_US"><Text>This unit cannot be trained. It is obtained through its civilization's or leader's ability (activate that ability to gain it).</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_ACTIVATE" Language="en_US"><Text>Activate</Text></Row>
