		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NOTIFICATION_UNLOCK_TITLE" Language="en_US"><Text>Conquest Unlocked</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_NOTIFICATION_UNLOCK_BODY" Language="en_US"><Text>By holding {2_City} you may now activate the abilities of {1_Leader}. Open the Civilization Conquest screen from the Launch Bar.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_MOD_MISMATCH_TITLE" Language="en_US"><Text>Mod Files Do Not Match</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CQ_MOD_MISMATCH_BODY" Language="en_US"><Text>The game database loaded on this computer differs from other players' (fingerprints shown below). The lobby only checks mod IDs, not file contents. Differences in rules will make the game go out of sync repeatedly; differences only in descriptive text are harmless, but still mean the mod files are not identical.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]This computer: {1_Local}[NEWLINE]{2_Others}[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Make sure everyone has exactly the same mod folders (delete old or duplicate copies, update Workshop mods to the same version), then restart the game and load again.</Text></Row>

